1
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:07,625
Redmond, where are you crawling to?

2
00:00:11,125 --> 00:00:13,500
Severin, you, uh...

3
00:00:13,625 --> 00:00:14,500
you need something?

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,250
I’m thinking of
erasing House Carter completely.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,416
What do you think?

6
00:00:19,416 --> 00:00:21,125
Of course, if you have any objections,

7
00:00:21,125 --> 00:00:22,500
I can erase you too.

8
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:27,291
That… that won’t be necessary.

9
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,125
Severin, you carry Carter blood!

10
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:36,791
You should help the family!

11
00:00:36,791 --> 00:00:38,125
Carter blood?

12
00:00:38,666 --> 00:00:39,625
Funny. You didn't mention that

13
00:00:39,666 --> 00:00:41,083
when you threw us out.

14
00:00:41,083 --> 00:00:42,041
I was wrong.

15
00:00:44,166 --> 00:00:47,625
I'll sign the entire house over to you
right now.

16
00:00:47,625 --> 00:00:49,250
You are the only heir!

17
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,875
Just save us!

18
00:00:50,875 --> 00:00:52,625
You think I give
a shit about that?

19
00:00:52,625 --> 00:00:54,375
The moment you chose Redmond,

20
00:00:54,375 --> 00:00:56,916
you signed House Carter’s death warrant.

21
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,750
Send word across the Sovereign Sanctum.

22
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:01,666
Within fifteen minutes,

23
00:01:01,666 --> 00:01:04,875
I want
House Carter erased from Golantis.

24
00:01:05,625 --> 00:01:06,750
As you command!

25
00:01:07,125 --> 00:01:08,500
Severin, don't do this!

26
00:01:09,541 --> 00:01:11,125
Go rot in hell 

27
00:01:11,125 --> 00:01:14,041
with your golden boy and your
snake of a wife.

28
00:01:14,041 --> 00:01:15,250
No!

29
00:01:25,916 --> 00:01:27,125
Severin.

30
00:01:27,125 --> 00:01:28,750
He's your father!

31
00:01:28,750 --> 00:01:30,208
- I never forgive those who have hurt me.
- Please，

32
00:01:30,666 --> 00:01:31,458
save him!

33
00:01:31,458 --> 00:01:33,041
No matter who they are.

34
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:34,000
Guards!

35
00:01:34,250 --> 00:01:35,500
Throw them out!

36
00:01:39,125 --> 00:01:40,625
Can it be lighter?

37
00:01:49,125 --> 00:01:51,125
Godfather!

38
00:01:51,416 --> 00:01:52,500
Please!

39
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:53,791
I didn't know!

40
00:01:53,791 --> 00:01:56,541
You loved torturing the
people beneath you, Jeyn.

41
00:01:56,541 --> 00:01:59,125
Let's see how
you like the executioner.

42
00:01:59,125 --> 00:02:01,625
Cassia, take him out.

43
00:02:01,625 --> 00:02:03,291
Standard execution.

44
00:02:03,291 --> 00:02:05,125
Yes, my lord!

45
00:02:13,125 --> 00:02:14,625
Please, Godfather!

46
00:02:14,625 --> 00:02:16,000
- Forgive us!
- Forgive us!

47
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,625
You all called my miner brothers "filth".

48
00:02:18,625 --> 00:02:20,541
Since that's
how you feel,

49
00:02:20,541 --> 00:02:23,250
your titles, lands, and wealth

50
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:26,333
will be stripped and confiscated.
